.el .ds Aq '
.TH geectl-prjconf-validate 1  "geectl-prjconf-validate 0.2.4" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-prjconf\-validate \- Validate a project\*(Aqs prjconf across its repositories. Exits 24 when error findings exist
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl prjconf validate\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPROJECT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Validate a project\*(Aqs prjconf across its repositories. Exits 24 when error findings exist.
.PP
The config is evaluated once per repository and architecture, with one buildconfig fetch per repository; package and owner lookups are cached across evaluations. At most 32 repositories are evaluated; a project with more is refused. Requires OBS credentials, checked before any request. A `%if` branch is reported dead only when it is dead in every evaluation.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fIPROJECT\fR>
The project to validate the prjconf of
.SH VERSION
v0.2.4
